# .dockerignore
#
# Stage 9: files Docker should NEVER copy into the image -- keeps the image small and
# avoids accidentally shipping your entire local venv (which can be hundreds of MB and
# is platform-specific anyway; the image installs its own clean dependencies instead).

.venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.git/
.gitignore
*.ipynb
.ipynb_checkpoints/
